/*
 * Copyright 2001 Association of Universities for Research in Astronomy, Inc.
 * See the file COPYRIGHT for more details.
 *
 * FILENAME:
 * diags.c
 *
 * FUNCTION NAME(S):
 *  bitHigh   -   Set bit in given port 
 *  bitLow   -   Clear bit in given port. 
 *  cleanInput   -   Cleans up input line 
 *  cmd   -   Interactive control of motor 
 *  cmdR   -   Send a command and read response 
 *  cmdSentorr   -   Send a command to SenTorr and print response 
 *  creep   -   Creep into a switch position 
 *  datumAll   -   Datum all motors 
 *  doAll   -   Move all the motors 
 *  doC_X   -   Send control-X 
 *  homeOffset   -   Determine home switch offset. 
 *  lvFakeTemp   -   Send fake temperature data to Labview. 
 *  lvMotorDump   -   Dump motor status to Labview 
 *  moveAll   -   Move all motors to new positions 
 *  mstat   -   Prints status of all motors 
 *  mstatus   -   Print motor status 
 *  parkAll   -   Park all motors 
 *  printIOBits   -   Print motor I/O bits 
 *  printMotorSwitch   -   Prints switch structure 
 *  printPortBits   -   Print port's bits in nice ascii format 
 *  printPressure   -   Print pressures 
 *  printTemp   -   Print information on a particular temperature channel 
 *  printTempVolts   -   Print temperature diode voltages 
 *  rdTemp   -   Read one channel multiple times 
 *  resetHealth   -   Force overall health to be 'GOOD' 
 *  setGrating   -   Set grating id 
 *  setMem   -   Set memory 
 *  statusString   -   Prints motor status flag 
 *  sysinfo   -   Print a lot of system information 
 *  unDatum   -   Clears datum flag 
 *  useAlt   -   Activate/deactivate alternative home switch 
 *  useLv   -   Enable/disable Labview connection. 
 *  xycomReport   -   Print all digital I/O bits 
 *  xycomWrite   -   Writes value into given port. 
 *
 *INDENT-OFF*
 * $Log: diags.wfd,v $
 * Revision 1.2  2009/05/27 19:32:10  fkraemer
 * fkraemer - copied my complete working dir over trunk
 *
 *INDENT-ON*
 *-
 */
