 * (>) cmd (char *)         Command to send
 *
 * FUNCTION VALUE:
 * (void) Returns 'void' and hence has no STATUS value
 *
 * PURPOSE:
 * Send a command and read response
 *
 * DESCRIPTION:
 * Sends a command to a motor and prints the response.  This routine
 * should be used only with commands that do have responses.
 *
