 * PARAMETERS: (">" input, "!" modified, "<" output)
 * (>) port (int)           Port to use
 * (>) bit (int)            Bit to clear
 *
 * FUNCTION VALUE:
 * (void) Returns 'void' and hence has no STATUS value
 *
 * PURPOSE:
 * Clear bit in given port.
 *
 * DESCRIPTION:
 * 
 *
 * EXTERNAL VARIABLES:
 *
 *
 * PRIOR REQUIREMENTS:
 *
 *
 * DEFICIENCIES:
